    "text": "Daily Northwestern\nwebsite\nEvanston\nEvanston and Chicago-area Juneteenth events commemorate Black independence\nBy Laura Horne,\n2 hours agoEvanston and Chicago-area organizations are hosting events to bring Black communities together for Juneteenth on Thursday. Recognized as a federal holiday in 2021, Juneteenth celebrates Black freedom and reflects on the emancipation of enslaved people 160 years ago. Check out these events happening throughout the week:. Juneteenth Breakfast with Jonathan...\n10",
